WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.543
Quick question.

00:00:01.743 --> 00:00:04.874
Why does getting a real estate license
still feel like piecing

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:07.400
together instructions from different websites,

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.353
outdated course materials,
and a hundred “Next” buttons?

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:12.558
Every state has its own rules.

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:15.324
Different education requirements.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.489
Different course hours.

00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:19.292
Different exams.

00:00:19.692 --> 00:00:21.637
Different licensing steps.

00:00:21.837 --> 00:00:25.570
And somehow, you're expected to figure out
the entire process on your own.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.496
That's why we built StateCourse.

00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:29.401
One national platform.

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:30.963
One account.

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:33.571
A clear licensing path
for every state we serve.

00:00:33.571 --> 00:00:36.702
Choose your state, and StateCourse
shows you what comes next:

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:38.486
required education,

00:00:38.886 --> 00:00:40.349
exam preparation,

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.273
application steps,

00:00:42.473 --> 00:00:44.821
fingerprinting and licensing requirements,

00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:47.169
and later, continuing education and renewal.

00:00:47.369 --> 00:00:49.013
And the course itself?

00:00:49.213 --> 00:00:51.140
No hours of mandatory video lectures.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.381
No filler.

00:00:52.581 --> 00:00:54.689
No endless clicking just to move forward.

00:00:54.689 --> 00:00:58.374
You learn through a serious digital textbook
built around clear

00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:02.675
explanations, real-world transactions,
state-specific law, practical

00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:04.950
examples, knowledge checks,

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.043
and human instructor support
when you need it.

00:01:07.043 --> 00:01:09.910
And StateCourse doesn't end
when the course ends.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.900
Your progress, certificates,
exam preparation,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.711
and next licensing step
stay together in one place.

00:01:15.711 --> 00:01:19.465
We're launching state by state
and expanding across the country.

00:01:19.465 --> 00:01:22.400
So whether you're getting
your first real estate license

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.130
or keeping the one you've already earned—

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.127
start with your state.
